  "details": "So I think vote systems should be removed for the original public lobbies as the trolls in this community have out grown the regular players so trolls can just start a false vote kick and out-number the regular players already in there. I was vote kicked out the blackcat yesterday in a regular public instance by a number of 8 troll players. I think the vote kick system should mainly be for group publics that away the report system isn't trying to make a meme around these nuisance from not being reported properly. There is major issues with people using the blackcat as a target system for the community that is actually there to hangout and chill. I bet if a regular player stayed in the instance for about 2hours they will see someone getting harassed or being the one harassed by these bad players. Really need a fix on the squad of people trying to bully and cause problems for people looking to chill and just talk to regular players.",
